# W4-WIN-CLOSE C2 review B1: a session that ends while the chunk builders are held must exit at once,
# not after the hold's 20 s watchdog (the workers parked in the gate are released before they are
# joined). Run with --gpu --max-seconds 15.
look 1140 516
key b
select 1307
rotate 0
wait frames 90
hold chunks
click 1156 516
wait outcome
wait blocked
expect held chunks
quit
